Description: Serial console server application for SONiC
 Installs the independent serial console server application, command-line
 tools, bootstrap configuration, SSH dispatch helper, and standalone
 seriald systemd unit. The package does not enable or start seriald.service;
 SONiC uses its separate console-server.service lifecycle.
